1. blocking — packages/cli/src/integrate.ts:231 The Patron preflight runs `git fetch origin <oid>` without suppressing `FETCH_HEAD` or automatic tag following, so it can mutate repository state and refs before issuing the required mutation-free refusal; its non-commit and indeterminate ancestry exits also fall through to the later ref-moving fetch. This is the preflight-order class; I searched every `patronStop` exit and all three `fetchTrunk` fetches; brief:164 — check: packages/cli/src/next.test.ts (W-141-b1 with an absent target, a remote tag, `FETCH_HEAD`, and all refs asserted unchanged)
